Title: Datasources: Add utility for getting the default datasource

Fixes https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/132269

### What changed?
This PR is removing the unstable API `useDefaultDataSourceInstanceListItem()` and updates the utility `getDefaultDataSourceInstanceListItem()` to work on a list of datasource instances and always return the sane default for that given list:

```ts
// USAGE - [FUNCTION]
// ---------------------------------------------------
const allItems = await getDataSourceInstanceList();
const promItems = await getDataSourceInstanceList({ type: 'prometheus' });

// Org level default
const orgDefault = await getDefaultListItem(allItems);

// Default prometheus ds instance
const promDefault = await getDefaultListItem(promItems);


// USAGE - [HOOK]
// ---------------------------------------------------
const { isLoading, error, items } = useDataSourceInstanceList();
const { 
  isLoading: defaultIsLoading, 
  error: defaultError, 
  item: defaultItem
} = useDefaultDataSourceInstanceListItem(items);
```
